Q1: What is DOM ?
Ans Document Object Model is a structured representation of the webpage which helps in making the webpage interactive.
Q2: What are 5 DOM Manipulation functions?
Ans:createElement(), appendChild(), remove(), setAttribute(),textContent()
Q3: What is meaning of asynchronous operation ?
Ans:A set of function that runs independently in the background, allowing the main program to continue running without waiting .
Q4: What is virtual Dom?
Ans:It is a lightweight copy of the actual browser(DOM) used by  React to update user interfaces efficiently.
Q5: How React responds fast to user actions ?
Ans: It uses virtual DOM .
